(6768558, 1014031, 54033, '<td valign="top"><br/>I got the blue from Posthumous<br/> <br/>While I and some friends were walking at night; this little Indian boy was climbing up and down a wall surrounding the Dubai Museum and one of my two photographer friends suggested I shoot the silhouette. I had to set him up as his original silhouette was not so powerful. The photo is near basic editing except for the bit of the purple/pink on the top right corner I felt needed to stop the orange.<br/> <br/>Thanks Posthumous</td>', 'I got the blue from Posthumous While I and some friends were walking at night; this little Indian boy was climbing up and down a wall surrounding the Dubai Museum and one of my two photographer friends suggested I shoot the silhouette. I had to set him up as his original silhouette was not so powerful. The photo is near basic editing except for the bit of the purple/pink on the top right corner I felt needed to stop the orange. Thanks Posthumous', '2012-05-14 04:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
