(6768772, 1014132, 94265, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mrchhas:</b></div><hr/><i> I''d say ya''ll did rather well at the end no? :D nice shot, I laughed! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Haha, thanks. I was sitting at around a 5.8 for most of the challenge, I only crept into the sixes when there was an hour left to go, some last-minute kind-hearted voters must have shown up!</td>', 'Originally posted by mrchhas: I''d say ya''ll did rather well at the end no? :D nice shot, I laughed!   Haha, thanks. I was sitting at around a 5.8 for most of the challenge, I only crept into the sixes when there was an hour left to go, some last-minute kind-hearted voters must have shown up!', '2012-05-14 11:27:56.000000', NULL, 0),
