(6768816, 1013750, 49954, '<td valign="top">I did not vote on this image.  I thought the font was either faked or just poorly done.  Lots of work as I can tell, but the net result doesn''t look like a spill to me.  That said, the border was distracting and unneeded (not a widescreen shot.    The composition also didn''t work for me.  Had I voted on it as it stands, I would have given it a 5.  (Sorry)</td>', 'I did not vote on this image.  I thought the font was either faked or just poorly done.  Lots of work as I can tell, but the net result doesn''t look like a spill to me.  That said, the border was distracting and unneeded (not a widescreen shot.    The composition also didn''t work for me.  Had I voted on it as it stands, I would have given it a 5.  (Sorry)', '2012-05-14 12:31:49.000000', NULL, 0),
