(6768932, 1013750, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by photogs notes:</b></div><hr/><i>Total prep and shooting time : 8 hours and 45 minutes. 173 shots taken </i></td></tr></table> <br/>An awful lot of time invested and rewarded with a 5.38. I''ve been there. In all honesty and illegit low votes aside, you have to step back and look at the final product objectively - for all the effort put in, it just doesn''t work, IMO. The composition, the scale of the shotglass and the skull seem weird and I don''t really get the visual concept/message as it relates to the title, but then some people obviously did. The bright side is that you got to drink the vodka. :) <br/> <br/>Hope you don''t take that as too harsh - whaddo I know anyway. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by photogs notes:Total prep and shooting time : 8 hours and 45 minutes. 173 shots taken  An awful lot of time invested and rewarded with a 5.38. I''ve been there. In all honesty and illegit low votes aside, you have to step back and look at the final product objectively - for all the effort put in, it just doesn''t work, IMO. The composition, the scale of the shotglass and the skull seem weird and I don''t really get the visual concept/message as it relates to the title, but then some people obviously did. The bright side is that you got to drink the vodka. :)  Hope you don''t take that as too harsh - whaddo I know anyway. :)', '2012-05-14 14:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
