(6769039, 1013829, 117474, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I''d say with a touch of selective sharpening on the top you would have beaten me! Not to take away from your lovely image though. Love the colours and bokeh!</td>', 'Very nice image. I''d say with a touch of selective sharpening on the top you would have beaten me! Not to take away from your lovely image though. Love the colours and bokeh!', '2012-05-14 17:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6769043, 1014075, 37629, '<td valign="top">hahah, hilarious. <br/> <br/>I enjoy the shot a lot.  For me a few things that are troublesome is the yellow hue of the shadow, I may have done a selective desaturation of the shadows that fall beside each balloon, it is subtle but may have made the colours pop a little more, The way the three circles line up in the shot (the openings of the balloons) are excellent, except it''s a little to the right, if it was a little more centred it may have looked a lot more precise and intentional but that''s being super nitpick. <br/>in PP i would''ve brought the mid tones down a touch and raised the blacks slightly to give it a little more depth, it feels a little bit flat as an image. I think the rectangular cropping however is successful. I feel it scored accordingly, it''s a simple shot and it''s almost at being elegantly simple and it''s also funny, the title is a #%@$ you to the voters haha.</td>', 'hahah, hilarious.  I enjoy the shot a lot.  For me a few things that are troublesome is the yellow hue of the shadow, I may have done a selective desaturation of the shadows that fall beside each balloon, it is subtle but may have made the colours pop a little more, The way the three circles line up in the shot (the openings of the balloons) are excellent, except it''s a little to the right, if it was a little more centred it may have looked a lot more precise and intentional but that''s being super nitpick. in PP i would''ve brought the mid tones down a touch and raised the blacks slightly to give it a little more depth, it feels a little bit flat as an image. I think the rectangular cropping however is successful. I feel it scored accordingly, it''s a simple shot and it''s almost at being elegantly simple and it''s also funny, the title is a #%@$ you to the voters haha.', '2012-05-14 17:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6769065, 1014195, 116574, '<td valign="top">This was a fast edit that I''m not totally happy with but the outing was a blast.  Steve was off taking pictures of Fort Travis and I walked the bike a bit further down the path we were taking.  Now remembering when walking the bike to STAY away from the pedals or they will bite my ankles.  I rode 13 miles on that tandem, took a lot of pictures and kissed the pavement, twice.  Best thing is, When are we doing it again?<br/> <br/></td>', 'This was a fast edit that I''m not totally happy with but the outing was a blast.  Steve was off taking pictures of Fort Travis and I walked the bike a bit further down the path we were taking.  Now remembering when walking the bike to STAY away from the pedals or they will bite my ankles.  I rode 13 miles on that tandem, took a lot of pictures and kissed the pavement, twice.  Best thing is, When are we doing it again? ', '2012-05-14 18:17:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6769068, 1013617, 107708, '<td valign="top">love it, great colour and depth - so sad to see the last drop going to waste though :(</td>', 'love it, great colour and depth - so sad to see the last drop going to waste though :(', '2012-05-14 18:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
