(6769602, 1014075, 146356, '<td valign="top">I personally liked the RGB - didnt make the rule of threes connection. The second image outtake you showed would have scored a bit higher for me, because it really makes me think about the emptiness after a party. the three empty baloons feels quickly put together, but the outtake tells more of a story. *edit: now thinking about the air forced out of the otherwise full (of air) baloons... They are in a sense, empty either way.* <br/> <br/>Thats how i feel about it anyways, take it with a grain of kosher salt<br/></td>', 'I personally liked the RGB - didnt make the rule of threes connection. The second image outtake you showed would have scored a bit higher for me, because it really makes me think about the emptiness after a party. the three empty baloons feels quickly put together, but the outtake tells more of a story. *edit: now thinking about the air forced out of the otherwise full (of air) baloons... They are in a sense, empty either way.*  Thats how i feel about it anyways, take it with a grain of kosher salt', '2012-05-15 15:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6769895, 1014147, 108544, '<td valign="top">This is such a strong image Wendy!<br/>Well deserving of a big old blue. Congratulations!<br/>Thanks for also sharing, your specs on the shoot. It really makes one appreciate, the image even more.<br/>Patience is so worth the effort.<br/>Well done...</td>', 'This is such a strong image Wendy!Well deserving of a big old blue. Congratulations!Thanks for also sharing, your specs on the shoot. It really makes one appreciate, the image even more.Patience is so worth the effort.Well done...', '2012-05-15 23:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6770144, 1013069, 6519, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paulsteven:</b></div><hr/><i> dddddddddddddfcd </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I still haven''t figured out that meaning of this "comment", but I don''t feel like emailing to ask about it.<br/> <br/>Funnily enough, though, life has been going on just fine, anyway  ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by paulsteven: dddddddddddddfcd  I still haven''t figured out that meaning of this "comment", but I don''t feel like emailing to ask about it. Funnily enough, though, life has been going on just fine, anyway  ;-)', '2012-05-16 01:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
