(6772820, 1013728, 9387, '<td valign="top">Margaret- I haven''t been a member in 12 years and just joined again.  Unfortunately, I didn''t get the opportunity to vote in this challenge, but as far as I''m concerned you deserved 1st place.  This is the winner. I looked at the score for you and the 2nd place winner and it appears hat you lost in the 7-8 range of votes.  He had 3 people who voted 10 and you had 13 people that voted 10.  I for ne vote 10+ for this shot and plan to add it to my favorites.  It was a job very well done.</td>', 'Margaret- I haven''t been a member in 12 years and just joined again.  Unfortunately, I didn''t get the opportunity to vote in this challenge, but as far as I''m concerned you deserved 1st place.  This is the winner. I looked at the score for you and the 2nd place winner and it appears hat you lost in the 7-8 range of votes.  He had 3 people who voted 10 and you had 13 people that voted 10.  I for ne vote 10+ for this shot and plan to add it to my favorites.  It was a job very well done.', '2012-05-18 18:00:57.000000', NULL, 0),
